<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Ladies
and Gentlemen:</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Wearable
Devices Ltd., an Israeli company (the&nbsp;<B><I>&ldquo;Company&rdquo;</I></B>), agrees, subject to the terms and conditions in this
agreement (this&nbsp;<B><I>&ldquo;Agreement&rdquo;</I></B>), to issue and sell to Aegis Capital Corp., (the&nbsp;<B><I>&ldquo;Underwriter&rdquo;</I></B>)
an aggregate of 4,444,444 ordinary shares (the&nbsp;<B><I>&ldquo;Firm Shares&rdquo;</I></B>), par value NIS 0.01 per share, of the Company
(the&nbsp;<B><I>&ldquo;Ordinary Shares&rdquo;</I></B>) and 0 pre-funded warrants (each, a&nbsp;<B><I>&ldquo;Pre-funded Warrant&rdquo;</I></B>)
each to purchase one Ordinary Share at an exercise price of $0.001 until such time as the Pre-funded Warrant is exercised in full subject
to adjustment as provided in the Pre-funded Warrant. The Ordinary Shares referred to in this Section are hereinafter referred to as the&nbsp;<B><I>&ldquo;Closing
Shares&rdquo; </I></B> and the Pre-funded Warrants referred to in this Section are hereinafter referred to as the&nbsp;<B><I>&ldquo;Closing
Pre-funded Warrants.&rdquo;</I></B>&nbsp;At the option of the Underwriter, the Company agrees, subject to the terms and conditions herein,
to issue and sell additional Option Securities (as defined herein). The Closing Shares and the Closing Pre-funded Warrants are herein
referred to collectively as the Closing Securities. The Closing Securities and the Option Securities are herein referred to collectively
as the&nbsp;<B><I>&ldquo;Securities&rdquo;</I></B>. The number of Closing Shares, Closing Pre-funded Warrants and Option Securities to
be purchased by the Underwriter is set forth opposite its name in Schedule I hereto. Aegis Capital Corp. has agreed to act as the Underwriter
in connection with the offering and sale of the Securities.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>&nbsp;</B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>Definitions</B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B><I>&nbsp;</I></B></FONT></P>

