<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B><I>&ldquo;Securities
Act&rdquo;</I></B>&nbsp;means the Securities Act of 1933, as amended, and the rules and regulations promulgated thereunder.</FONT></P>

